        "cooked": "<p>The only good thing about three heroes against Cosmotron is H is low, so he outputs way less damage.</p>\n<p>There's still nothing good about this fight. No ongoing destruction that I could find, though at least no one in the team deals the same type of damage, so you can kind of ignore the adaptive plating subroutines. Not really sure what will actually make you&nbsp;<em>win</em>, though.</p>",
