        "created_at": "2020-05-22T22:35:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Finally beat it with a Mint. Not sure there's any particular strategy to follow, though I'll note that getting the EPE to line up with Visionary having Wrest the Mind took me a while. Finished the job though!</p>",
